    - The brain MCP entry's prescription is always derived from the scaffolded brain config — its launcher shape, its arguments, and any unwired slots flow from the config bytes through the parser and interpolator unchanged. The scaffolded config's launcher follows the launch mode chosen for the brain server, global by command name alone or local through the package runner.
    - This category plans only the brain config scaffold and the brain MCP entry, leaving brain entry-point artifacts and the brain root to the integration's own prose. Its brain step in the install summary carries only state flags, section markers and sizes, on every brain status.
