- Observed brain-aide-invalid repair session in another project (2026-10-10, relayed by the orchestrator) -- the 74 KB of 77 KB response size, harness offload, eight already-present seeds, and the about-3 KB target.
- `.aide/intent.aide` (Strategy) -- the proportional-cost decision this flow narrows to tool-response size.
- `src/.aide` (frontmatter) -- only install, sync and consent-gated upgrade surfaces write host files, which places the insertion in the upgrade's brain category.
